<section id="problem-finder">
  <div class="section-label">Find Your Starting Point</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">What Are You Trying to <em>Fix?</em></h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Choose a challenge to explore the relevant service.</p>
  <div class="problem-grid">
    <button class="problem-card fade-in" type="button" onclick="chooseChallenge('Costs rising',1)"><div class="problem-icon">↘</div><h3>Costs are rising</h3><p>Find procurement, overhead, logistics, working-capital, and margin leakage before it compounds.</p><div class="problem-link">View margin path →</div></button>
    <button class="problem-card fade-in fade-in-delay-1" type="button" onclick="chooseChallenge('Founder dependency',3)"><div class="problem-icon">◎</div><h3>Business depends on me</h3><p>Build SOPs, dashboards, and delegation systems so daily decisions stop bottlenecking at the founder.</p><div class="problem-link">Build systems →</div></button>
    <button class="problem-card fade-in fade-in-delay-2" type="button" onclick="chooseChallenge('Supply chain delays',2)"><div class="problem-icon">⇄</div><h3>Supply chain is unreliable</h3><p>Map supplier risk, inventory buffers, fulfilment delays, and delivery visibility before growth breaks service levels.</p><div class="problem-link">Fix flow →</div></button>
    <button class="problem-card fade-in" type="button" onclick="chooseChallenge('ERP confusion',null,'#erp')"><div class="problem-icon">⌘</div><h3>ERP decision is confusing</h3><p>Clarify process requirements, vendor fit, data ownership, and implementation risks before spending on software.</p><div class="problem-link">Check ERP fit →</div></button>
    <button class="problem-card fade-in fade-in-delay-1" type="button" onclick="chooseChallenge('Need SOPs',3)"><div class="problem-icon">☷</div><h3>Team lacks SOPs</h3><p>Document critical work, train teams, and reduce recurring mistakes caused by informal processes.</p><div class="problem-link">Create operating rhythm →</div></button>
    <button class="problem-card fade-in fade-in-delay-2" type="button" onclick="chooseChallenge('Need growth roadmap',0)"><div class="problem-icon">✦</div><h3>Need a growth roadmap</h3><p>Turn ambition into a clear 3-year plan with priorities, KPIs, ownership, and review cadence.</p><div class="problem-link">Shape strategy →</div></button>
  </div>
</section>
